    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">a Unique Arcade Shooter Set In Space </h2>In Comet Clash, the goal is to keep comets from diminishing what\u2019s left of your home planet\u2019s population. You, the Space Cadet, take control of an enormous Space Shield that hovers around the planet on your command. The General is there to keep spirits high and more or less instruct you on how to control the Shield.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 different comet types<br></li><li>Boss fights<br></li><li>Upgrades<br></li><li>Leaderboards<br></li><li>Narration</li></ul>",
